# Changelog

All notable changes to the Research Facility IT Hub project are documented in this file.

The format is based on keeping a clear record of website development, new features, improvements and fixes.

- 2026-10-10

# Added
- Created the Research Facility IT Hub website project.
- Added index.html as the main homepage.
- Added it-structure.html for the IT department structure and responsibilities.
- Added security.html for information security guidelines.
- Added acceptable-use.html for the acceptable IT use policy.
- Added acquisition.html for IT acquisition procedures.
- Added service-desk.html for IT support and service desk information.
- Added disaster-recovery.html for disaster recovery procedures and backup guidance.
- Added  Colour Palette and Visual Design
| Colour | Hex Code | Purpose |

| Navy Blue | #142B45 | Main headings, navigation text and primary backgrounds |
| Dark Teal Blue | #20546B | Hero section gradient |
| Teal | #18A999 | Buttons, progress bar and visual highlights |
| Light Teal | #E8F8F5 | Backup section and checklist accents |
| Light Grey-Blue | #F5F8FC | Main page background |
| White | #FFFFFF | Cards and content sections |
| Slate Grey | #536477 | Paragraphs and supporting text |
| Border Grey | #E2E9F0 | Card borders and checklist dividers |
| Dark Navy | #0C1C2E | Footer background |
- Added README.md to document the project overview, objectives, technologies and file structure.
- Added website navigation to help users access the different sections.
- Reference List
