Cisco Systems (2023) Spanning Tree Protocol (STP) Overview. Available at: https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/support/docs/lan-switching/spanning-tree-protocol/5234-5.html (Accessed: 10 October 2026).
Independent Institute of Education (IIE) (2026) XITM5229MM IIE Module Manual: Task 2 – Standard Operating Procedures, Disaster Recovery Plans and Website Design. Johannesburg: IIE.
