# Improved
- Organised IT information into separate pages for easier navigation.
- Established a consistent structure for presenting IT policies and procedures.
- Included guidance on cybersecurity, responsible technology use and data protection.
- Included disaster recovery steps and an interactive recovery checklist on the disaster recovery page.

# Security
- Included information security awareness and responsible IT use guidance.
- Highlighted the importance of secure backups and recovery testing.
- Emphasised the need to protect confidential research information.

# Documentation
- Documented the purpose and features of each website page.
- Added instructions for opening and testing the website.
- Recorded possible future improvements.

# Planned
- Test all navigation links and page functionality.
- Check the website on desktop, tablet and mobile devices.
- Review HTML and CSS for errors and consistency.
- Improve accessibility and usability.
- Consider adding a functional IT support request form.
- Consider adding a searchable IT knowledge base.
- Review and update documentation as the project develops.